[0.139, "o", "\u001b[32;1m✓\u001b[0m \u001b[36;1malice\u001b[0m staged as \u001b[33;1mPending \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2mnext: unheld verify alice   (compare the digits out loud)\u001b[0m\r\n"]
